{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"${VAR}"},{"text":" in a configuration file resolves from the process environment at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"load time:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["datasource:","  url: \"${DATABASE_URL}\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"yaml"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"With an optional fallback, for a value that has a sensible default but should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stay overridable:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["datasource:","  pool_size: ${DB_POOL_SIZE:-10}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"yaml"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is how a file stays committable while the values that vary — and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values that are secret — come from the deployment platform.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"An-unresolved-variable-fails-the-load","level":2,"text":"An unresolved variable fails the load"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"${VAR}"},{"type":"text","text":" with no fallback, referencing a variable that is not set, fails"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the entire load:"}]},{"code":["alula-prod.yaml: key 'datasource.url' references environment variable","'DATABASE_URL' via ${DATABASE_URL}, which is not set. Set it, or use","${DATABASE_URL:-default} to supply a fallback."],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The alternative would be to let the key fall through to the base layer — and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the base layer is the development file. A production deployment quietly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"running against a development database is precisely the outcome worth","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refusing to boot over.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Substituted-values-are-treated-as-secrets","level":2,"text":"Substituted values are treated as secrets"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A value that arrived through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"${VAR}"},{"type":"text","text":" came from the deployment environment,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is where credentials live. So it is redacted in any diagnostic dump:"}]},{"code":["String(reflecting: provider)","\/\/ AlulaYAML[alula.yaml, 2 keys: db.host=localhost, db.password=<REDACTED>]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A literal written into the file is printed as-is — it is already disclosed by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the file it lives in, so hiding it would be theater."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The distinction is recorded at parse time, because the placeholder is gone by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the time anyone reads the resolved value. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AlulaYAMLDocument.substitutedKeys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exposes it if you need it."}]},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This covers values that came through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"${VAR}"},{"text":" in a YAML layer.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A provider you supply through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"additionalProviders"},{"text":" is responsible for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"marking its own values secret — swift-configuration’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ConfigValue"},{"text":" carries","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSecret"},{"text":" flag for exactly that.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Safe-and-unsafe-logging","level":2,"text":"Safe and unsafe logging"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AlulaConfig\/documentation\/AlulaConfig\/Configuration\/description"},{"type":"text","text":" names the layers and how many keys each holds,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without printing any of them. It is safe to log unconditionally:"}]},{"code":["print(configuration)","\/\/ Configuration (environment: prod), 3 providers, highest precedence first:","\/\/   1. EnvironmentVariables[12 values]","\/\/   2. AlulaYAML[alula-prod.yaml, 4 keys]","\/\/   3. AlulaYAML[alula.yaml, 18 keys]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AlulaConfig\/documentation\/AlulaConfig\/Configuration\/debugDescription","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" adds the values, with secrets redacted by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whichever provider holds them.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Where-secrets-should-actually-live","level":2,"text":"Where secrets should actually live"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Environment variables, injected by your deployment platform. That is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"${VAR}"},{"type":"text","text":" is for, and it is why the environment-variable layer sits at the top"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the precedence order."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a real secret manager, write a "},{"code":"ConfigProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and layer it in:"}]},{"code":["let configuration = try Configuration.load(","    additionalProviders: [vaultProvider]",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inli